## AI Review Checklist
- [ ] Generated code follows existing patterns (error handling, naming, structure)
- [ ] No new dependencies that duplicate existing functionality
- [ ] No duplicate utility functions or types
- [ ] Tests verify behavior, not just execution
- [ ] Changes are scoped to the stated task (no surprise refactors)
- [ ] No hardcoded values that should be configurable
- [ ] Auth checks present on all protected endpoints
